# tools/dup_lines_ratchet.exclude -- paths the duplicated-line ratchet must not scan.
# One glob per line (fnmatch against the repo-relative path; '*' crosses '/').
# A trailing '/' excludes a whole directory; a pattern without '/' matches file names only.
# Built in already: 3rdparty/, shaders/spv/, *.gen.h, *.gen.hglsl, linguist-generated paths.
# Add vendored or machine-written sources here with a reason; do NOT add first-party
# copy-paste to hide it -- that is exactly what the ratchet exists to surface.

# The VK frame-UBO includes are written by tools/gpu_abi_gen.py from RenderCore/gpu_abi/*.h (the
# *.gen.hglsl siblings are already built in); their lines mirror the source header by construction.
shaders/vulkan/include/*_frame_ubo_vk.glsl
